OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, will extend northeast this
OL,7,Fmorning. This afternoon will be cloudy
OL,8,Fwith spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,9,FTurning drier later in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FApart from the odd shower
OL,12,Fthis evening will be dry. Then the
OL,13,Frest of the night will be dry across
OL,14,Fall parts with lengthy clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be a dry day
OL,17,Feverywhere with some good spells of
OL,18,Fsunshine. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
