OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,6,Fon Tuesday with some patchy rain
OL,7,Flater. Early rain on Wednesday then
OL,8,Fmainly dry and bright. Bright with the
OL,9,Fodd shower on Thursday.
